FACTORY_DEF {*} TeeFactory    FACTORY_NAME { TestFilter_2_INPUT }    INPUT  FEATURE_TYPE StringCaseChanger_OUTPUT    OUTPUT FEATURE_TYPE TestFilter_2_INPUTLINE
